<description>&lt;p&gt;An ambush in eastern DR Congo struck forces linked to Erik Prince's security firm, killing an ex-New Zealand special forces officer and wounding former UFC fighter Tim Kennedy and a retired US Green Beret. The attack occurred amid intensified fighting around the M23 rebel campaign. An African Union panel is meeting President Tshisekedi in Kinshasa as part of shuttle diplomacy on the crisis. The UCDP recorded 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPQTI2RlpMX051UHBQd0tyT0R2LXlDUFRjTUxfRnZqNWhTMWN3ZVdXUGZqSnVkUEV0am9SVXJkRHoyVEx0ajQtUTBhNV9ER2JLUGZLemZSRU5tVVRPX1NmNEdtZGtQcmZfWUFPWmVlVExLeWtnYzNGQlVRamwyc0pzMXV1blVzd09hRG51eklyR0FxVjhrNEdJRmlKUVlMLWtSU1hSQ1daMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxPSnRfZTRYeTRDaDlhaTVnODk3Z2xDU2wtSlUzQ0luYmNfZGlTNGRNOVBvVURsTklDYjFSUFRvT2ZEYjd3RUxLSmZQUUlNcGRCS1VYLS1NdUJ6Q0ZoU2RqemlXNWROWHNnYkFBVEc2bmp0T201UnJmaEhhMmhlRTk1c2d5eDBXc2tkcWgweWRmbW8wMThWcHIzUkhpbVZWRjhQRW1JMW1wNU5EeVVJWVhWR3gxblRqaG11UjlzajB3YjI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNYnNhbmVMRGdqU25EVXFXVkhkOG9VYUZDaVVkTzN1LXZCcUcyQ3NwcnFIZVFZOWV6V3BGTjF4c2JBRHZ3aWloNnU5Z25rNGZneVBsV0lNeUxYSHBZRDNXZ3otYWF6NmNveFBFMVpERHJZeV9WaXZPMzJNaFQ4U3MyTHlDY1g2Ri1tTGxhR0FIUFEyOW9hR0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQWVlWd0dpZ0NjN0tPSXpnekVuaDd6ckVVczEyUk5QdUFGNWZfTWhKNzZDOEEwcGVjRXlVdEVTVUJpdklOYXVqSnlSSGJxTHZQVDAwUnZSV2xYMEphZGZrVTF2NTdMcm1aRFVXZzZHMUlVc0t2YnBBZVZZeHR4T0YwMldSaVhGWm04TFJ3TGk2WDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Newsweek&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nilepost&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google